# Threat-intelligence snapshots (CISA KEV, FIRST EPSS) and their regenerable outputs.
# Snapshots and manifests are local provenance records; regenerate with
# `python -m src.fetch_threat_intelligence` rather than committing large feeds.
data/external/
data/processed/vulnerabilities_enriched_current.csv
data/processed/threat_intel_coverage.json

# Rejected-CVE audit (Phase 2.1) and its regenerable outputs. The authoritative
# CVE status snapshot also lives under data/external/ (already ignored above);
